#: extension_logic.py:85
msgid "Enable Fast Start for MP4/MOV output (moves moov atom, creates new suffixed file)"
msgstr "为 MP4/MOV 输出启用快速启动（移动 moov 原子，创建带后缀的新文件）"

#: extension_logic.py:72
msgid "Fast Start Suffix"
msgstr "快速启动后缀"

#: extension_logic.py:72
msgid "Suffix for the fast start file (e.g., '-faststart', '_optimized'). Applied globally. Invalid characters will be replaced. If blank, defaults to '-faststart'."
msgstr "快速启动文件的后缀（例如 '-faststart'、'_optimized'）。全局应用。无效字符将被替换。留空则默认为 '-faststart'。"

#: extension_logic.py:85
msgid "Use Fast Start"
msgstr "使用快速启动"
